<p>Your skill in Hymns now improves your sight in darkness, increasing your infravision radius by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0, 1, 2, 2, 3.</acronym></p><p>Also, when you end a Hymn, you will gain a buff of a type based on which Hymn you ended.</p><p>Hymn of Shadows increases your movement speed by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">379%, 510%, 612%, 698%, 774%</acronym> for one turn.</p><p>Hymn of Detection makes you invisible (power <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">17, 23, 28, 31, 35</acronym>) for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">5, 7, 8, 9, 10</acronym> turns.</p><p>Hymn of Perseverance grants a damage shield (power <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">313, 422, 506, 577, 641</acronym>) for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">5, 7, 8, 9, 10</acronym> turns.</p>